  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceans_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你熱愛海洋，這款為《Loading Backgrounds》模組設計的搭配資源包絕對適合你！它將標準的載入畫面替換為令人驚嘆的海洋圖片&mdash;從水生生物、海底遺跡到深海威脅，應有盡有。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loading-backgrounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Backgrounds</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>你需要伺服器與朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你想找一個伺服器來和朋友一起玩任何模組或整合包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是你的最佳選擇！他們提供最具性價比的 Minecraft 伺服器，並且只要點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼「Lupin」，即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>它能在伺服器上使用嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！運作非常完美！記得與朋友一起玩模組的最佳方式就是使用 BisectHosting，並且透過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結即可獲得 25% 折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個資源包能用於整合包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！前提是僅發布於 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 平台。將其上傳至任何其他平台都將侵犯我們的權益，且絕對不被允許。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果你考慮將其加入你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包，我們將不勝感激。若需要任何小調整或有任何問題，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製關於此模組的影片並在我的頻道分享嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！你完全可以在你的頻道遊玩此模組或我們的任何整合包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會非常感謝你！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceansscreenshot1.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceansscreenshot2.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceansscreenshot3.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceans_screenshot4.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
